# Copy to .env.build (and/or per-image files) for docker-build.ps1 layering — see merge order in docker-build.ps1 header.
# Do not put secrets here: build-args can end up in image/build metadata. Use runtime env_file / BuildKit secrets instead.
#
# Layering (later overrides earlier):
#   1) nornir-docker/example._shared.build.env   (this file — committed defaults)
#   2) nornir-docker/<dir>/example.<tag>.build.env  (per image, co-located with Dockerfile — see README)
#   3) $NORNIR_DOCKER_USER_ROOT/_shared.build.env and per-tag paths mirroring nornir-docker layout (optional, not in git)
#   4) Invocation directory (usually monorepo root): .env.build and .env.build.<tag-with-hyphens>
#
# Per image tag (colon -> hyphen in filename for CWD legacy files):
#   nornir:dev              -> .env.build.nornir-dev
#   nornir:dev-cursor-base  -> .env.build.nornir-dev-cursor-base
#   nornir:cursor-worker    -> .env.build.nornir-cursor-worker
#   nornir:prod             -> .env.build.nornir-prod
#   nornir:cupy             -> .env.build.nornir-cupy
#
# Examples (uncomment as needed):
# CUPY_PACKAGE=cupy-cuda12x
# MAGICKVERSION=7.1.1-27
